    <DataNode elementId="AT4G34135-MONOMER" textLabel="flavonol 3-O-glucosyltransferase" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT4G34135.1" dataSource="TAIR gene name" />
      <Graphics centerX="750" centerY="535" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The cDNA encoding a flavonol 3-&lt;i&gt;O&lt;/i&gt;-glucosyltransferase (AtGT-1) was isolated from &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt;. Its molecular function of attaching glucose to the 3-&lt;i&gt;O&lt;/i&gt;-position of the C-ring was confirmed as recombinant protein expressed in &lt;i&gt;E. coli&lt;/i&gt;. However, although the enzyme preferred to glucosylate the 3-&lt;i&gt;O&lt;/i&gt;-position of flavonols such as kaempferol, quercetin and isorhamnetin, flavonoids missing the 3-hydroxyl group such as the flavanones eriodictyol and naringenin or the flavones luteolin and apigenin were glucosylated with high efficiency at the 7-&lt;i&gt;O&lt;/i&gt;-position of the A-ring |CITS: [KIM06]|. In contrary to the reported substrate specificity of this enzyme another author reported the characterization of an enzyme encoded by the same locus (At4g34135) that has been specific for the 7-&lt;i&gt;O&lt;/i&gt;-position (A-ring) of flavonols, flavanones and flavones but also had a lower affinity to glucosylate the 3-&lt;i&gt;O&lt;/i&gt;-position (C-ring) of kaempferol and quercetin, eventually also forming the flavonol 3,5-diglucosides |CITS: [14697269]|. The reversed position preference of the two reported enzymes originating from the same locus remains to be validated but may reflect the low substrate specificity of that glucosyltransferase (UGT73B2). Additional information: The Arabidopsis locus At4g34135 consists of two splice variants (At4g34135.1 and At4g34135.2)</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT4G34135-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Araport" value="AT4G34135.1" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pid" value="AAR01231" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33443, RXN-15418, RXN-15426, RXN-15440, RXN-15446, RXN-15432, RXN-13130, RXN-13131, RXN-13132, RXN-13127, RXN-13128, RXN-13129" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="12" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT4G34135.1" />
      <Property key="FunctionalAssignmentStatus" value=":PROBABLE-ENZYME" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT4G34135" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_KIM06" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_14697269" />
    </DataNode>
